@testray.main.component.name = "Patcher Builder"
Feature: Patcher Builder Smoke testing
  	Testing the Patcher Builder smoke test.
  
  Setup:
  	* I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage

  Scenario: Run test smoke test
    @priority = "5"
    @test.group = "3"
    As a TSE, I should be able to run the test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke job

    Given I start the test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke job with the following parameters
      | git.branch      | 2.x     |
      | github.username | liferay |
    And I wait for "5" seconds
    And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
    And I get the current build number for the short job titled "test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke(2x-uat)"
    And I check the job with the name "test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke(2x-uat)" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" for completion
    And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
    Then the job with the name "test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke(2x-uat)" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" should have been successful
